of mental figuring out and intellectualizing, that\h
that becomes pretty much their way of scratching\hthe itch;

65
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:08,959
their way of cultivating the same\h
context of unwholesome kind of seeking\h\h

66
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:16,239
gratification at the wrong place. It would\h
be fed through that same... because that\h

67
